---
permalink: /en/
title: "Palomino Islands Tour — Swim with sea lions in Lima"
description: "Sail with the pioneers of marine ecotourism in Peru. Palomino Islands tour from La Punta, Callao: swim with 5,000+ sea lions. Book on WhatsApp."
eyebrow: "Ecocruceros · La Punta, Callao"
---
{% set t = i18n[lang] %}

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__media"><img src="/assets/img/hero-swim-lobos.jpg" alt="Guests swimming with sea lions at the Palomino Islands, Callao"></div>
  <div class="container hero__inner reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--c-mustard-300)">{{ eyebrow }}</p>
    <h1>Swim with the sea lions of the Palomino Islands</h1>
    <div class="hero__rotator" data-rotator data-interval="4200" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="rot rot--lg is-on">Visit the Palomino Islands</span>
      <span class="rot">On comfortable, safe two-deck yachts</span>
      <span class="rot">Swim with sea lions</span>
      <span class="rot">Daily departures · by reservation</span>
    </div>
    <p class="lead">A yacht trip from La Punta, Callao, to a colony of more than 5,000 sea lions — with the <strong>pioneers of marine ecotourism in Peru</strong>.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/en/tour/" style="color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)">{{ t.seeTour }}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__trust">
      <a class="proof" href="{{ site.tripadvisor.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="stars">★</span> 4.6 · 193 {{ t.trust.reviews }} <span class="proof-rank">· No. 10 of 97 in Lima · TripAdvisor</span></a>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:var(--space-3);color:#eaf4f8;font-size:.9rem">{{ t.weReply }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TRUST STRIP -->
<section class="section" style="padding-block:var(--space-12)">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="trust-strip">
      <div class="item"><span class="num tnum">30</span> years of experience</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="num tnum">4.6★</span> · 193 reviews</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="num tnum">5,000+</span> sea lions</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="num tnum">30 min</span> from central Lima</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- THE EXPERIENCE -->
<section class="section section--sky">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="media">
      <figure class="media__figure">
        <img class="zoomable" src="/assets/img/galeria/g6.jpg" alt="Guest in a life vest swims next to a sea lion in the turquoise water of the Palomino Islands" loading="lazy">
      </figure>
      <div class="media__body">
        <p class="eyebrow">The experience</p>
        <h2>A real encounter with Pacific wildlife</h2>
        <p>From the private pier in La Punta we sail out to the Palomino Islands, where you can swim alongside a colony of sea lions in their natural habitat.</p>
        <ul class="checklist" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">
          <li><strong>5,000+ sea lions</strong> · optional swim</li>
          <li>Humboldt penguins and guano birds at Cavinzas</li>
          <li>Whale sightings in some months · not guaranteed</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/en/tour/">{{ t.seeTour }} →</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT'S INCLUDED -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="media media--reverse">
      <figure class="media__figure">
        <img class="zoomable" src="/assets/img/galeria/g1.jpg" alt="Smiling visitor in a life vest swims in front of the Palomino Islands sea lion colony" loading="lazy">
      </figure>
      <div class="media__body">
        <p class="eyebrow">What's included</p>
        <h2>Everything ready for your trip</h2>
        <ul class="feature-icons">
          <li><span class="fi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 7c1.8 1.6 3.6 1.6 5.5 0s3.7-1.6 5.5 0 3.7 1.6 5.5 0"/><path d="M2 13c1.8 1.6 3.6 1.6 5.5 0s3.7-1.6 5.5 0 3.7 1.6 5.5 0"/><path d="M2 19c1.8 1.6 3.6 1.6 5.5 0s3.7-1.6 5.5 0 3.7 1.6 5.5 0"/></svg></span><span><b>Swim with sea lions</b><small>In their natural habitat</small></span></li>
          <li><span class="fi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.4-3 7.6-7 9-4-1.4-7-4.6-7-9V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><span><b>No need to swim well</b><small>Life vest on board</small></span></li>
          <li><span class="fi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v10H9l-4 4z"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 12h5"/></svg></span><span><b>Bilingual guide</b><small>English &amp; Spanish</small></span></li>
          <li><span class="fi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9h12l-1.2 9.2A2 2 0 0 1 14.8 20H9.2a2 2 0 0 1-2-1.8z"/><path d="M9 9V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v3"/></svg></span><span><b>Drinks &amp; snacks</b><small>Unlimited on board</small></span></li>
          <li><span class="fi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3.5s6 5.8 6 9.7a6 6 0 0 1-12 0c0-3.9 6-9.7 6-9.7z"/></svg></span><span><b>Wetsuits</b><small>In the cold season</small></span></li>
          <li><span class="fi-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.4-3 7.6-7 9-4-1.4-7-4.6-7-9V6z"/><path d="M12 9.5v5M9.5 12h5"/></svg></span><span><b>Travel insurance</b><small>All passengers</small></span></li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:var(--space-4);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-secondary)">Does not include the SERNANP fee (S/26 residents · US$8 foreigners).</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)"><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/en/tour/precios/">{{ t.seePricing }} →</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SCHEDULE / FACT BAND -->
<section class="section section--warm" style="padding-block:var(--space-12)">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="factbar">
      <div><b>3½ hours</b><span>an unforgettable trip</span></div>
      <div><b>30 min</b><span>from central Lima</span></div>
      <div><b>Daily departures</b><span>by reservation</span></div>
      <div><b>Private pier</b><span>in La Punta, Callao</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SUSTAINABILITY -->
<section class="section section--dark">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Sustainability</p>
    <h2>"Eco" is not a label</h2>
    <p class="lead">We operate inside a National Reserve, with low-impact practices and the backing of sustainable-tourism certifications.</p>
    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)"><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/en/sostenibilidad/">{{ t.nav.sustain }} →</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- REVIEWS -->
<section class="section section--sky">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="media">
      <figure class="media__figure">
        <img class="zoomable" src="/assets/img/galeria/g2.jpg" alt="Three smiling passengers in life vests swim in front of the Palomino Islands sea lion colony" loading="lazy">
      </figure>
      <div class="media__body">
        <p class="eyebrow">What our passengers say</p>
        <h2>4.6★ on TripAdvisor · 193 reviews</h2>
        <p>No. 10 of 97 attractions in Lima. Real reviews from travellers who have already sailed with us.</p>
        <a class="proof" href="{{ site.tripadvisor.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="stars">★</span> 4.6 · 193 {{ t.trust.reviews }} <span class="proof-rank">· TripAdvisor</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% if reviews and reviews.length %}
    <div class="review-carousel" data-carousel style="margin-top:var(--space-12)">
      <div class="review-track" data-carousel-track>
        {% for r in reviews %}
        <div class="review-slide"><article class="review-card">
          <div class="review-stars" title="5 of 5" aria-label="5 of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          {% if r.title_en %}<h3 class="review-title">{{ r.title_en }}</h3>{% endif %}
          <p class="review-text">“{{ r.text_en }}”</p>
          <p class="review-meta">{{ r.name }}{% if r.location_en %} · {{ r.location_en }}{% endif %}{% if r.date_en %} · {{ r.date_en }}{% endif %}<br><span class="review-source">via TripAdvisor</span></p>
        </article></div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="carousel-nav">
        <button type="button" class="carousel-btn" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous review">‹</button>
        <button type="button" class="carousel-btn" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next review">›</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PRICING CLOSE -->
<section class="section section--sea cta-band">
  <div class="container center reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p>
    <h2>Clear pricing, no surprises</h2>
    <div class="price-compare" style="text-align:left;max-width:700px;margin-inline:auto">
      <div class="pc">
        <span class="pc-who">Residents in Peru</span>
        <div class="pc-from">{{ t.from }} S/179 <small>/ adult</small></div>
        <span class="pc-all">+ S/26 SERNANP fee = <b>S/205 per person, all in</b></span>
      </div>
      <div class="pc pc--gold">
        <span class="pc-who">International visitors</span>
        <div class="pc-from">{{ t.from }} US$69 <small>/ adult</small></div>
        <span class="pc-all">+ US$8 SERNANP fee = <b>US$77 per person, all in</b></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:var(--space-6)">
      <a class="btn btn--gold" data-wa-source="home-pricing" href="{{ t.wa.pricing | wa }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ t.book }}</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/en/tour/precios/">{{ t.seePricing }} →</a>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:var(--space-3);color:#dff1f8;font-size:.9rem">{{ t.weReply }}</p>
  </div>
</section>
